<title>USA: NYSE closing averages. [CORRECTED 22:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages. [CORRECTED 22:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 51.57 to 6858.11.</p>
<p>(Corrects to show Dow rose, not fell)</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.74 to 414.09, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.18.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1302 to 1186.</p>
<p>Volume was 480,590,220 compared with 467,564,770 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
